  "title": "Part 5 動詞題",
  "titleEn": "Verb Forms",
  "summary": "時態、主動被動、單複數：動詞題一次搞定。",
  "minutes": 12,
  "steps": [
    {
      "kind": "concept",
      "title": "重點觀念",
      "body": [
        "Part 5 常常四個選項都是同一個動詞的不同形態，例如 open、opened、will open、has opened。",
        "解題三步驟：① 找時間字決定時態 ② 主詞是單數還是複數 ③ 主詞是「自己做」還是「被做」。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "explain",
      "title": "解題技巧",
      "body": [
        "先記住這張表："
      ],
      "table": {
        "head": [
          "線索",
          "用什麼",
          "例子"
        ],
        "rows": [
          [
            "next month、tomorrow",
            "未來式 will ＋ V",
            "will open"
          ],
          [
            "yesterday、ago、last…",
            "過去式",
            "submitted"
          ],
          [
            "since 2018、for five years",
            "現在完成式 have／has ＋ p.p.",
            "has worked"
          ],
          [
            "each、every ＋ 單數名詞",
            "單數動詞",
            "Each employee receives…"
          ],
          [
            "主詞是被做的",
            "被動 be ＋ p.p.",
            "Orders are shipped."
          ]
        ]
      },
      "tip": "since ＋ 時間點（since 2018）、for ＋ 一段時間（for five years），都是現在完成式的好朋友。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "examples",
      "title": "聽聽看",
      "items": [
        {
          "en": "The new branch will open next month.",
          "zh": "新分店下個月開幕。",
          "highlight": "will",
          "audio": "assets/audio/lessons/toeic-p5-2/ex1.mp3"
        },
        {
          "en": "All orders are shipped within two business days.",
          "zh": "所有訂單都在兩個工作天內出貨。",
          "highlight": "shipped",
          "audio": "assets/audio/lessons/toeic-p5-2/ex2.mp3"
        },
        {
          "en": "Ms. Tanaka has worked here since 2018.",
          "zh": "田中小姐從 2018 年就在這裡工作。",
          "highlight": "has",
          "audio": "assets/audio/lessons/toeic-p5-2/ex3.mp3"
        },
        {
          "en": "Each employee receives a parking card.",
          "zh": "每位員工都會拿到一張停車卡。",
          "highlight": "receives",
          "audio": "assets/audio/lessons/toeic-p5-2/ex4.mp3"
        }
      ]
    },
